			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Giant Crab (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nxECUZiDX_8S0D5xT",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nkRyeKWwiQO7lsA-q",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 120 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nzxJvSJUYUMO6hS9e",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary); water Move 5. The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "noKis9mQsSbrzrHxD",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nHxhpqjw7apJ3Gkba",
			"text": "About two metres across the leg span, which is the SM 0 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "ny9SHwhVf24YeT35b",
			"text": "ST raised from an earlier draft: Basic Lift has to cover dragging a body back to the water, which is the thing the creature is for."
		},
		{
			"id": "neFDXhrSxCW9zAAEt",
			"text": "DR is full armour: a carapace is shell, not hide."
		},
		{
			"id": "nV_4VJG2qTv16llsB",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
